 "duration": 92.183,
 "sentences": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "text": "Since you started scrolling, your heart has beaten hundreds of times… and you never told it to once.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 6.072,
   "firstWord": 0
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "text": "And it's never waited for you.",
   "start": 6.397,
   "end": 7.976,
   "firstWord": 18
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "text": "So who's been running the show?",
   "start": 8.58,
   "end": 10.031,
   "firstWord": 24
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "text": "Tucked in the heart's upper right chamber is a tiny patch of cells called the SA node.",
   "start": 10.635,
   "end": 15.987,
   "firstWord": 30
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "text": "It's your built-in pacemaker.",
   "start": 16.428,
   "end": 18.018,
   "firstWord": 47
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "text": "It fires its own electrical spark, about 100,000 times a day.",
   "start": 18.169,
   "end": 23.022,
   "firstWord": 51
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "text": "It never asked you once.",
   "start": 23.347,
   "end": 24.717,
   "firstWord": 62
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "text": "Heart cells grown in a dish, with no body and no brain, start beating on their own.",
   "start": 25.1,
   "end": 30.615,
   "firstWord": 67
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "text": "So what does your brain do?",
   "start": 31.056,
   "end": 32.357,
   "firstWord": 84
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "text": "You know that jolt from a jump scare, when your heart races before you even think?",
   "start": 32.868,
   "end": 37.465,
   "firstWord": 90
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "text": "That's your brain cranking the volume up.",
   "start": 38.162,
   "end": 40.159,
   "firstWord": 106
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "text": "Falling asleep, it turns it down.",
   "start": 40.542,
   "end": 42.202,
   "firstWord": 113
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "text": "Try it now: breathe in slowly and your pulse speeds up slightly.",
   "start": 42.585,
   "end": 46.579,
   "firstWord": 119
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "text": "Breathe out, it slows.",
   "start": 46.904,
   "end": 48.483,
   "firstWord": 131
  },
  {
   "n": 15,
   "text": "Here's the twist: most of the time, your brain is pressing the brake.",
   "start": 48.924,
   "end": 52.663,
   "firstWord": 135
  },
  {
   "n": 16,
   "text": "In a heart transplant, the nerves are cut.",
   "start": 53.104,
   "end": 55.472,
   "firstWord": 148
  },
  {
   "n": 17,
   "text": "The new heart still beats… just faster.",
   "start": 55.797,
   "end": 58.595,
   "firstWord": 156
  },
  {
   "n": 18,
   "text": "It even has backups, like your phone's low-power mode.",
   "start": 59.036,
   "end": 61.951,
   "firstWord": 163
  },
  {
   "n": 19,
   "text": "If the main spark fails, a second spot takes over, slower.",
   "start": 62.276,
   "end": 65.933,
   "firstWord": 172
  },
  {
   "n": 20,
   "text": "If that fails, a third, slower still.",
   "start": 66.258,
   "end": 68.452,
   "firstWord": 183
  },
  {
   "n": 21,
   "text": "And when backups aren't enough, doctors fit a pacemaker.",
   "start": 68.836,
   "end": 71.947,
   "firstWord": 190
  },
  {
   "n": 22,
   "text": "That small bump some grandparents have under the collarbone?",
   "start": 72.272,
   "end": 75.07,
   "firstWord": 199
  },
  {
   "n": 23,
   "text": "That's it, doing the SA node's job.",
   "start": 75.581,
   "end": 78.425,
   "firstWord": 208
  },
  {
   "n": 24,
   "text": "The one catch: your heart still needs oxygen, and breathing is your brain's job.",
   "start": 78.751,
   "end": 84.056,
   "firstWord": 215
  },
  {
   "n": 25,
   "text": "But the beat?",
   "start": 84.497,
   "end": 85.333,
   "firstWord": 229
  },
  {
   "n": 26,
   "text": "It's doing that right now.",
   "start": 85.612,
   "end": 87.028,
   "firstWord": 232
  },
  {
   "n": 27,
   "text": "Without asking.",
   "start": 87.272,
   "end": 88.155,
   "firstWord": 237
  },
  {
   "n": 28,
   "text": "Follow for more things your body does without asking you.",
   "start": 88.596,
   "end": 92.183,
   "firstWord": 239
  }
 ],
